WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.150
What's going on here in Los
Angeles? Let me tell you.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.290
California governor Gavin
Newsom just released

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:09.070
a four-tier system to guide
the state's reopening.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.420
Now, Los Angeles is
still in the bottom tier,

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.660
which means we have a long way to go

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.900
until things get back to normal.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.150
Now, some people still feel

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:22.490
that governor Newsom is
reopening California too slowly.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.280
And of course, people on the other side

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.580
think his new system is appropriate.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.780
But I figure the easiest way to tell

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:32.750
how things are in Los Angeles

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.160
is just to take a look outside myself,

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:41.160
and judge what's going on
during this period of COVID.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.110
I'm gonna do that right now.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.290
The best way to find out,
just check for yourself,

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.730
see how Los Angeles

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:52.360
is doing.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.567
This'll take a second.

00:00:54.498 --> 00:00:57.248
(mournful music)

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:03.410
(people screaming and shouting)

00:01:06.698 --> 00:01:07.802
(container thuds)

00:01:07.802 --> 00:01:10.428
(explosion booms)

00:01:10.428 --> 00:01:13.471
(horns blare)
(tires squeal)

00:01:13.471 --> 00:01:18.471
(explosion booms)
(sign whistles)

00:01:21.221 --> 00:01:26.221
(people screaming)
(dramatic music)

00:01:41.652 --> 00:01:44.819
(water tower crashes)

00:01:48.665 --> 00:01:50.271
Little more time.

00:01:50.271 --> 00:01:53.724
(shoes stomp)
Little more time.

00:01:53.724 --> 00:01:54.650
Didn't like that.

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:58.253
I don't frankly know where the
tarantula invasion came from.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:01.883
That surprised me.

